      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can't be...",
      "translation" : "不可能..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've been reborn, haven't you?",
      "translation" : "你已經轉生了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I see you're retreading the path of the Swordman! Once you've gotten used to brandishing a sword, you can never go back!!",
      "translation" : "看來你又走上了劍士之路！習慣揮劍之後，就再也回不去了！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm? Ah, you must first master the Basic Skills before you are ready to become a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "嗯？啊，你得先精通基本技能，才能準備好成為劍士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Come back to me when you have finished learning the Basic Novice Skills.",
      "translation" : "學完初學者的基本技能後再來找我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Excellent! Let me promote you to a Swordman right away!",
      "translation" : "很好！我馬上幫你轉職為劍士！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... You look like a well-experienced Swordman. Still, I'm sure that you must train to improve your skills and gain strength!",
      "translation" : "嗯...你看起來是個經驗豐富的劍士。不過，我相信你還得繼續訓練，提升技巧、增強實力！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm...?",
      "translation" : "嗯...？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You're a reborn",
      "translation" : "你是轉生後的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "warrior, aren't you?",
      "translation" : "戰士，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmmm...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems that being",
      "translation" : "看來成為"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a Swordman is not part",
      "translation" : "劍士並非你的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of your destiny. I'm sorry,",
      "translation" : "命中註定。抱歉，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "but it seems there is nothing",
      "translation" : "我似乎幫不了"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can do for you.",
      "translation" : "你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is the Swordman Guild.",
      "translation" : "這裡是劍士公會。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why are you here?",
      "translation" : "你來這裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tell me about being a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "告訴我劍士的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to be a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "我想成為劍士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Nothing.",
      "translation" : "沒事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So you wish to know more about the mighty Swordman? Okay!",
      "translation" : "想了解強大的劍士？好啊！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The most distinctive feature of the Swordman is that the Swordman can show us his/her real abilities in close combat.",
      "translation" : "劍士最突出的特點是，他們能在近身戰鬥中發揮真正的實力。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are three reasons!",
      "translation" : "原因有三點！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "First, Swordman has higher HP than other jobs.",
      "translation" : "第一，劍士的HP比其他職業高。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Second, except for Bows and Rods, Swordman can use all other weapons so they can fight at their optimal ability.",
      "translation" : "第二，除了弓和手杖，劍士可以使用其他所有武器，因此能發揮出最佳戰力。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And third, most of the skills of the Swordman give powerful physical attacks.",
      "translation" : "第三，劍士的大多數技能都能發動強力的物理攻擊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Though I gave you a simple explanation, I believe you understand the core meaning of what it is to be a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "雖然我只是簡單介紹了一下，但我相信你已經明白劍士的核心特點。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In my opinion, Swordman is the best job ever!",
      "translation" : "在我看來，劍士是最棒的職業！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are already an excellent Swordman, aren't you?",
      "translation" : "你已經是個出色的劍士了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Just devote yourself to be a great Swordman.",
      "translation" : "只管專心成為一名偉大的劍士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You already have one of the other jobs, don't you?",
      "translation" : "你已經有其他職業了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've gone too far with that joke.",
      "translation" : "這個玩笑開得太過分了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry to tell you this but to be a Swordman, you must reach at least ^4A4AFFJob Level 10^000000.",
      "translation" : "很抱歉，想成為劍士，至少必須達到^4A4AFF職業等級10^000000，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "and ^4A4AFFBasic Skill Level 9^000000.",
      "translation" : "並且達到^4A4AFF基本技能等級9^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Want to be a Swordman without having the minimum requirement?",
      "translation" : "還沒達到最低要求就想成為劍士？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you think being a Swordman is that easy?",
      "translation" : "你以為劍士這麼容易當嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm, both your Job Level and Basic Skill Level check out.",
      "translation" : "嗯，你的職業等級和基本技能等級都符合要求。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good. Do you want to be a Swordman right away?",
      "translation" : "很好。現在就轉職為劍士嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I do.",
      "translation" : "是的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll consider it again.",
      "translation" : "我再考慮一下。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yeah. Prudent decision is needed for choosing a job.",
      "translation" : "嗯，選擇職業時應該謹慎。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But I feel sorry... that you consider it again after overcoming all the hardships....",
      "translation" : "不過你克服了那麼多困難之後，竟然又要重新考慮...我真替你惋惜。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Congratulations! From now on, you are going to live a Swordman's life!",
      "translation" : "恭喜！從現在起，你將踏上劍士之路！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's do it right now!",
      "translation" : "現在就開始吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士公會職員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Congratulations again for being a Swordman and I hope that you participate in many activities for the revival of our guild.",
      "translation" : "再次恭喜你成為劍士！希望你積極參與公會復興活動。"
    }
  ]
